stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT
  DRAFT --> PENDING_APPROVAL : submit
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : approve, triggers BOM explosion
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : reject with comment
  REJECTED --> DRAFT : revise ⚠
  APPROVED --> IN_PROGRESS : start manufacturing
  IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : all items ready
  DRAFT --> CANCELLED : cancel with reason
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : cancel
  APPROVED --> CANCELLED : cancel, reverse reservations
  IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED : cancel ⚠
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
